# Received text beyond ASCII: Spleen's own Latin-1/Cyrillic, the Noto fallback
# layer (Greek, Latin Extended-A, typographic punctuation), and code points no
# layer has, which show the replacement box.
rx dm 0 Café résumé naïve — “quotes” and … dots
rx dm 0 Καλημέρα κόσμε, Привет, мир! Łódź Żółć ő €5
rx dm 0 Nothing here: 日本 ✓ ★ and a broken byte
wait 200
key enter
shot unicode-chat
key down 4
shot unicode-chat-2
key down 6
shot unicode-chat-3
key esc
